@node Top
@top datetime

This manual documents @code{datetime} version @value{VERSION}, a small C99 program that prints the current date and time. It is compatible with GNU @code{date} and keeps legacy formats.

@menu
* Overview::              What datetime does
* Invocation::            How to run datetime
